main#top.main
  include ../../../partials/navbar-vertical.pug
  include ../../../partials/navbar-top.pug
  include ../../../partials/searchbox-modal.pug
  .content
    nav.mb-2(aria-label='breadcrumb')
      ol.breadcrumb.mb-0
        li.breadcrumb-item
          a(href='#!') Page 1
        li.breadcrumb-item
          a(href='#!') Page 2
        li.breadcrumb-item.active Default
    .mb-9
      .row.align-items-center.justify-content-between.g-3.mb-4
        .col-auto
          h2.mb-0 Customer details
        .col-auto
          .row.g-3
            .col-auto
              button.btn.btn-phoenix-danger
                span.fa-solid.fa-trash-can.me-2
                | Delete customer
            .col-auto
              button.btn.btn-phoenix-secondary
                span.fas.fa-key.me-2
                | Reset password
      .row.g-5
        .col-12.col-xxl-4
          .row.g-3.g-xxl-0.h-100
            .col-12.col-md-7.col-xxl-12.mb-xxl-3
              .card.h-100
                .card-body.d-flex.flex-column.justify-content-between.pb-3
                  .row.align-items-center.g-5.mb-3.text-center.text-sm-start
                    .col-12.col-sm-auto.mb-sm-2
                      .avatar.avatar-5xl
                        img.rounded-circle(src='/images/team/15.webp' alt='')
                    .col-12.col-sm-auto.flex-1
                      h3 Ansolo Lazinatov
                      p.text-800 Joined 3 months ago
                      div
                        a.me-2(href='#!')
                          span.fab.fa-linkedin-in.text-400.hover-primary
                        a.me-2(href='#!')
                          span.fab.fa-facebook.text-400.hover-primary
                        a(href='#!')
                          span.fab.fa-twitter.text-400.hover-primary
                  .d-flex.flex-between-center.border-top.border-dashed.border-300.pt-4
                    div
                      h6 Following
                      p.fs-1.text-800.mb-0 297
                    div
                      h6 Projects
                      p.fs-1.text-800.mb-0 56
                    div
                      h6 Completion
                      p.fs-1.text-800.mb-0 97
            .col-12.col-md-5.col-xxl-12.mb-xxl-3
              .card.h-100
                .card-body.pb-3
                  .d-flex.align-items-center.mb-3
                    h3.me-1 Default Address
                    button.btn.btn-link.p-0
                      span.fas.fa-pen.fs-0.ms-3.text-500
                  h5.text-800 Address
                  p.text-800
                    | Shatinon Mekalan
                    br
                    | Vancouver, British Columbia
                    br
                    | Canada
                  .mb-3
                    h5.text-800 Email
                    a(href='mailto:shatinon@jeemail.com') shatinon@jeemail.com
                  h5.text-800 Phone
                  a.text-800(href='tel:+1234567890') +1234567890
            .col-12
              .card.h-100
                .card-body
                  h3.mb-4 Notes on Customer
                  textarea.form-control.mb-3(rows='4')
                  button.btn.btn-phoenix-primary.w-100.mb-4 Add Note
                  .fs--1.fw-semi-bold.pb-3.mb-4.border-bottom.border-dashed.border-300
                    p.text-1000.mb-1 Gave us a nice feedback
                    .text-end
                      p.text-600.mb-0 12 Nov, 2020
                  .fs--1.fw-semi-bold.pb-3.mb-4.border-bottom.border-dashed.border-300
                    p.text-1000.mb-1
                      | Customer added product to cart and then forgot to checkout. Later knocked the customer support to ask about update on shipping. Later, settled on &#xFFFD;&#xFFFD;&#xC3F0;ne day Shipping&#xFFFD;&#xFFFD;&#xFFFD; though &#xFFFD;&#xFFFD;&#xC3E4;ree delivery&#xFFFD;&#xFFFD;&#xFFFD; was preferred. Overall good behavior.
                    .text-end
                      p.text-600.mb-0 23 Dec, 2019
                  .fs--1.fw-semi-bold.pb-3.mb-4.border-bottom.border-dashed.border-300
                    p.text-1000.mb-1
                      | User of this support ticket won a 100% off coupon and received top-notch service from the technical support engineer. Along with providing a good review, user highly appreciated the team.
                    .text-end
                      p.text-600.mb-0 2 Oct, 2019
                  .fs--1.fw-semi-bold
                    p.text-1000.mb-1
                      | Customer returned and bought 2 related items, which is currently being shipped. Customer chose &#xFFFD;&#xFFFD;&#xC3F0;ne day Shipping&#xFFFD;&#xFFFD;&#xFFFD;. Additional notes were added regarding customised wrapping. Customer submitted positive review.
                    .text-end
                      p.text-600.mb-0 26 Apr, 2019
